        </custom_item>
      </condition>

      <then>
        <report type:"PASSED">
          description : "1.301 OL08-00-040080"
          info        : "OL 8 must be configured to disable the ability to use USB mass storage devices.

GROUP ID: V-248837
RULE ID: SV-248837r986386

USB mass storage permits easy introduction of unknown devices, thereby facilitating malicious activity."
          solution    : "Configure OL 8 to disable the ability to use the USB Storage kernel module and to use USB mass storage devices.

$ sudo vi /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist.conf

Add or update the lines:

